Package: pulzr-probe
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: pulzr-base
Description: Names the radios plugged into the gateway.
 Reads each USB serial adapter's and Bluetooth controller's identity from
 sysfs, names it from a table of known adapters, probes only what it can name,
 and reports radios.detected in the claim report and the MQTT state. Run by
 hotplug and once at boot. Built from github.com/pulzar-net/pulzr-edge with the
 OpenWrt SDK; see sdk/packages/pulzr-edge.
